      "preserveReason": "api_symbol",
      "contextBefore": "```swift\nobject WiFi.QoSMarkingPolicy\n```",
      "contextAfter": "`QoSMarkingAllowListAppIdentifiers` ([string]): An array of app bundle identifiers that defines the allow list for L2 and L3 marking for traffic that goes to the Wi-Fi network. If the array isn’t present, but the `QoSMarkingPolicy` key is present — even empty — no apps can use L2 and L3 marking. Available in iOS 14.5 and later, macOS 14 and later, tvOS 9 and later, visionOS 1 and later, and watchOS 3.2 and later.",
      "documentTitle": "WiFi.QoSMarkingPolicy",
