      "blockId": "list:properties:0008",
      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "`QoSMarkingAppleAudioVideoCalls` (boolean): If `true`, adds audio and video traffic of built-in audio or video services, such as FaceTime and Wi-Fi Calling, to the allow list for L2 and L3 marking for traffic that goes to the Wi-Fi network. Available in iOS 10 and later, macOS 10.13 and later, tvOS 9 and later, visionOS 1 and later, and watchOS 3.2 and later.",
      "normalizedSource": "`QoSMarkingAppleAudioVideoCalls` (boolean): If `true`, adds audio and video traffic of built-in audio or video services, such as FaceTime and Wi-Fi Calling, to the allow list for L2 and L3 marking for traffic that goes to the Wi-Fi network. Available in iOS 10 and later, macOS 10.13 and later, tvOS 9 and later, visionOS 1 and later, and watchOS 3.2 and later.",
