      "contextAfter": "`QoSMarkingEnabled` (boolean): If `true`, disables L3 marking and only uses L2 marking for traffic that goes to the Wi-Fi network. If `false`, the system behaves as if Wi-Fi doesn’t have an association with a Cisco QoS fast lane network. Available in iOS 10 and later, macOS 10.13 and later, tvOS 9 and later, visionOS 1 and later, and watchOS 3.2 and later.",
